WEBVTT

00:23.970 --> 00:27.600
With so little ability, there's no way you can win.

00:30.240 --> 00:32.010
I will not lose!

00:35.780 --> 00:38.310
I will definitely not lose!

00:46.390 --> 00:47.120
Hayate!

00:48.460 --> 00:49.430
Was it my imagination?

00:50.460 --> 00:52.330
Miss, breakfast is rea...

00:56.000 --> 00:57.590
Must be hearing things.

01:02.690 --> 01:05.960
The boundless future stretches across the skies

01:02.690 --> 01:05.960
hateshinai mirai hirogaru kono sora

01:05.960 --> 01:10.000
And I am reborn anew

01:05.960 --> 01:10.000
atarashii jibun ni umare kawaru

01:10.000 --> 01:17.020
I'll make the snow of happiness fall all over the world

01:10.000 --> 01:17.020
sekaijuu shiawase no yuki o furasete miseru yo

01:21.160 --> 01:21.360
Prétear

01:29.250 --> 01:36.160
Destiny is there to be grasped, so stretch out your hands

01:29.250 --> 01:36.160
unmei wa tsukamu mono kono te jiyuu ni nobaseba ii

01:36.160 --> 01:40.950
There is no tomorrow which has already been decided

01:36.160 --> 01:40.950
kimerareta ashita wa nai

01:43.000 --> 01:49.900
Even if you say nothing, I know our meeting that day was no coincidence

01:43.000 --> 01:49.900
damatte ite mo wakaru ano hi deai wa guuzen janai

01:49.900 --> 01:54.810
I sensed eternity in your distant gaze

01:49.900 --> 01:54.810
tooi hitomi ni eien kanjita

01:56.640 --> 02:00.510
The light of the setting sun is beautiful

01:56.640 --> 02:00.510
kurete yuku yuuhi ga kirei

02:00.510 --> 02:03.650
If the cold wind glimmers

02:00.510 --> 02:03.650
tsumetai kaze ga hikareba

02:03.650 --> 02:09.420
I can hear your voice drifting gently

02:03.650 --> 02:09.420
anata no koe sotto kikoeteru

02:09.590 --> 02:09.890
Knowing that I'm not alone in my heart

02:09.590 --> 02:14.360
kokoro no naka hitori janai koto itai hodo

02:14.360 --> 02:16.900
Warms it so much that it hurts

02:14.360 --> 02:16.900
kono mune o atsuku suru

02:16.900 --> 02:19.630
It all begins from the point of believing

02:16.900 --> 02:19.630
hajimaru ne shinjiru koto kara

02:19.630 --> 02:23.300
These feelings are proof of being alive

02:19.630 --> 02:23.300
kono kimochi ikiru akashi

02:23.300 --> 02:23.600
The endless future and the expanding skies

02:23.300 --> 02:26.510
hateshinai mirai hirogaru kono sora

02:26.510 --> 02:30.540
Allow me to be reborn anew

02:26.510 --> 02:30.540
atarashii jibun ni umare kawaru

02:30.540 --> 02:36.650
I'll make the snow of happiness fall all over the world

02:30.540 --> 02:36.650
sekaijuu shiawase no yuki o furasete miseru yo

02:36.650 --> 02:41.250
Holding hands with you

02:36.650 --> 02:43.250
sono te tsunaide

02:43.510 --> 02:46.880
The Secret of Rouge

02:47.750 --> 02:48.580
Here!

02:51.120 --> 02:53.480
How is it, Kaoru? Is it good?

02:54.890 --> 02:57.860
Ultra delicioso! It's very delicious!

02:57.860 --> 03:00.590
I can taste your love in it!

03:00.590 --> 03:04.160
So, this is the mouth which says such embarrassing things.

03:04.160 --> 03:04.890
Here!

03:06.130 --> 03:10.000
It's good! It smells like your love!

03:10.000 --> 03:12.840
Miss Himeno, would you like another serving of bread?

03:10.340 --> 03:12.840
<i>Oh, that's fantastic!</i>

03:12.840 --> 03:14.810
<i>Here, have another.</i>

03:15.340 --> 03:16.900
Which one would you like?

03:17.440 --> 03:18.640
<i>Delicious! Delicious!</i>

03:18.340 --> 03:20.660
Oh, no thanks.

03:18.640 --> 03:20.650
<i>Oh, I'm so happy!</i>

03:20.650 --> 03:21.670
I've had enough.

03:25.250 --> 03:26.510
I'm done.

03:27.250 --> 03:31.090
Do you have a fever? Or is your stomach not feeling well?

03:31.090 --> 03:32.360
Why?

03:32.360 --> 03:35.360
Because you don't have an appetite at all!

03:35.360 --> 03:38.760
After having eaten all this, you say she didn't have an appetite?

03:38.760 --> 03:43.570
Natsue, this is something I can tell because I'm her father.

03:43.570 --> 03:46.160
When feeling well, Himeno isn't like this.

03:46.840 --> 03:48.700
She picks clean any specks of rice left in the rice cooker!

03:49.240 --> 03:51.670
She devours scraps of vegetables like a wild animal!

03:52.140 --> 03:55.050
She wolfs down leftover food in a pot, then the pot as well!

03:55.050 --> 03:56.750
The hell I do!

03:56.750 --> 03:58.580
Eeeeek! Kaoru!

03:58.580 --> 03:59.850
Miss Himeno!

03:59.850 --> 04:01.450
Oh, yes, I am sorry.

04:01.450 --> 04:05.090
Himeno! I'm worried about you!

04:05.090 --> 04:06.490
Get off of me!

04:06.490 --> 04:08.760
<i>Miss Himeno! How dare you do that to your father?!</i>

04:08.760 --> 04:10.230
<i>Oh, I am sorry!</i>

04:33.050 --> 04:35.650
Hayate, where have you gone?

04:36.090 --> 04:37.490
Prepare to die.

04:40.390 --> 04:41.960
That's not fair!

04:41.960 --> 04:44.690
Mannen! It's my turn next!

04:45.530 --> 04:46.930
Try and catch me!

04:46.930 --> 04:48.630
Not fair, not fair!

04:48.630 --> 04:53.170
If I don't pull it together, those kids will be the ones who will suffer!

04:55.040 --> 04:58.440
Miss, it might be best not to go through with this.

04:58.440 --> 05:00.110
Shut up!

05:00.110 --> 05:05.550
My elegant prank is almost too good for the likes of Himeno anyway!

05:06.850 --> 05:10.720
Just marvel at this innovative high quality contraption!

05:11.690 --> 05:14.260
The moment she opens this door, before she knows it,

05:14.260 --> 05:16.850
...idiot Himeno will be nailed by squid ink.

05:18.500 --> 05:21.120
Mr. Tanaka, I'm going out for a while.

05:23.200 --> 05:25.440
Miss Mayune, well...

05:25.440 --> 05:27.740
Tanaka!

05:27.740 --> 05:29.540
Was it me?

05:29.540 --> 05:31.410
Was it my fault?

05:39.080 --> 05:41.520
Looking for clues concerning the Princess of Disaster?

05:44.660 --> 05:47.320
Right now, Himeno can't beat her.

05:48.390 --> 05:50.860
I don't want Himeno to fight her.

05:50.860 --> 05:53.870
I don't want Himeno to get hurt.

05:53.870 --> 05:56.060
Hayate, you...

06:01.710 --> 06:03.970
Sasame's not here.

06:05.210 --> 06:07.950
Hey, is Himeno over there?

06:07.950 --> 06:09.950
Nope, I couldn't find her.

06:09.950 --> 06:11.850
She's not over here either.

06:11.850 --> 06:15.350
Jeez! Where could she have gone anyway?!

06:15.350 --> 06:17.260
She'll probably be back soon.

06:17.260 --> 06:19.360
Why don't we wait in Himeno's room?

06:19.360 --> 06:22.260
Dummy! Then there's no point in being her guards!

06:22.260 --> 06:26.060
If Go finds out about this, he'll kick our asses.

06:26.700 --> 06:28.030
Hey!

06:28.030 --> 06:30.940
You kids! Sneaking in again?!

06:30.940 --> 06:33.000
Oh, damn. It's Chrome Dome Tanaka!

06:33.000 --> 06:33.990
Run!

06:35.140 --> 06:36.300
Say, Kei.

06:36.940 --> 06:38.600
What is it?

06:39.410 --> 06:40.570
What are you doing?

06:41.250 --> 06:45.080
Can't you tell? I'm working.

06:45.080 --> 06:49.390
No, I mean what kind of game are you making?

06:49.390 --> 06:51.260
Do you play games?

06:51.260 --> 06:52.790
Not really.

06:52.790 --> 06:55.090
Then you wouldn't understand even if I told you.

06:55.090 --> 06:56.320
That's right, isn't it?

06:59.100 --> 07:00.720
Did something happen?

07:01.400 --> 07:02.870
Well, not really.

07:04.240 --> 07:05.600
Is it about Prétear?

07:07.610 --> 07:11.240
It will be all right. While your powers are still developing,

07:11.240 --> 07:14.680
...there's still some time before the Princess of Disaster's revival.

07:14.680 --> 07:17.250
All you need to do is become stronger in the meantime.

07:17.250 --> 07:18.720
You've got us too.

07:19.650 --> 07:20.620
Here.

07:21.190 --> 07:23.150
Don't hesitate taking it. It's a good luck charm.

07:23.150 --> 07:24.820
Yeah, thanks.

07:25.990 --> 07:27.760
Oh, Himeno!

07:27.760 --> 07:29.750
Welcome, have a seat.

07:33.000 --> 07:35.690
What's with that look on your face? What's the matter?

07:36.630 --> 07:37.970
So you're worried about something?

07:39.740 --> 07:43.200
That's not like you at all! Buck up, Himeno!

07:45.140 --> 07:47.870
Here, have it, my treat.

07:48.550 --> 07:51.050
Don't complain about not much being there.

07:51.050 --> 07:52.680
This job doesn't pay well.

07:53.220 --> 07:57.210
Eat it and go back to your old self. I'm counting on you!

07:58.360 --> 07:59.850
Thanks, Go.

08:03.760 --> 08:05.630
What am I doing?

08:05.630 --> 08:07.600
What do I want to do?

08:13.910 --> 08:15.610
No good, not like this.

08:15.610 --> 08:16.900
I have to be stronger.

08:17.440 --> 08:18.540
It will be all right.

08:18.540 --> 08:19.810
I'm counting on you!

08:20.510 --> 08:23.210
I keep relying on everyone else.

08:23.950 --> 08:24.920
But...

08:25.550 --> 08:26.540
Miss Himeno?

08:27.390 --> 08:28.750
Mikage!

08:28.750 --> 08:30.050
Are you shopping?

08:30.050 --> 08:31.820
Well, I...

08:35.590 --> 08:38.160
Really? So you bought those clothes!

08:38.160 --> 08:40.630
On my next day off, I have a date.

08:41.370 --> 08:42.960
So you've got a boyfriend now?!

08:53.650 --> 08:55.040
Mawata...

08:59.650 --> 09:01.650
I'm going to make a sculpture out of clay.

09:01.650 --> 09:04.860
I thought it'd be fun to use something besides plaster for once.

09:04.860 --> 09:06.960
How about it? Wanna try it with me?

09:06.960 --> 09:08.760
Well, I don't...

09:08.760 --> 09:11.160
Well, yeah.

09:11.160 --> 09:13.100
You'll dirty your hands.

09:13.100 --> 09:15.000
Oh, sorry, sorry.

09:15.000 --> 09:17.370
Did it seem like I'm coercing you? Am I being a pest?

09:18.500 --> 09:20.300
Want to try it after all?

09:21.540 --> 09:25.480
I didn't know you sculpted with clay before.

09:26.140 --> 09:27.710
I was very little when I did it though.

09:27.710 --> 09:29.110
Well, it's understandable.

09:29.110 --> 09:31.820
You have a wonderful studio here after all.

09:31.820 --> 09:33.350
Make whatever you want.

09:33.350 --> 09:35.010
If there's something you don't know about, just ask.

09:54.240 --> 09:55.540
Kaoru!

09:55.540 --> 09:58.110
Just look at this costume!

09:58.110 --> 10:00.910
It really looks good on you, Natsue.

10:01.550 --> 10:05.250
Allow me to play with the clay today as well!

10:05.250 --> 10:06.980
What?! Really?

10:06.980 --> 10:08.150
Lucky!

10:09.990 --> 10:10.890
What?

10:10.890 --> 10:13.390
Where did Mawata go?

10:13.390 --> 10:15.660
Do you know? What?

10:24.700 --> 10:25.940
<i>That's true.</i>

10:25.940 --> 10:29.600
<i>If you could have someone with you when you're sad, that would be wonderful.</i>

10:30.340 --> 10:31.140
Sasame...

10:33.340 --> 10:34.650
Something happen?

10:34.650 --> 10:35.680
No.

10:35.680 --> 10:38.350
Let's increase our area of investigation.

10:38.350 --> 10:39.610
I'll go get some help.

10:47.860 --> 10:51.320
Are the squid ink tacos not to your liking?

10:52.460 --> 10:54.400
Oh, no, that's not it.

10:55.730 --> 10:57.790
They're good, really good.

10:58.340 --> 11:01.840
Miss Himeno, you haven't been yourself since this morning.

11:01.840 --> 11:03.810
Is there something that's disturbing you?

11:04.710 --> 11:07.650
Well, that is, disturbing me?

11:07.650 --> 11:10.750
Well, I started to think and got more confused.

11:10.750 --> 11:14.650
In that case, you should think in a methodical manner.

11:14.650 --> 11:17.310
What's the cause of this, anyway?

11:18.160 --> 11:19.560
Cause?

11:19.560 --> 11:20.590
The reason is...

11:20.590 --> 11:22.720
Of course, it's got to be LOVE!

11:23.260 --> 11:26.830
Oh, don't say it, don't say it!

11:26.830 --> 11:30.440
You got scared because you don't know how he feels, right?

11:30.440 --> 11:32.440
Oh, I understand!

11:32.440 --> 11:34.410
Here we go again.

11:35.110 --> 11:38.410
The head is cloudy because it's so full of uneasiness and expectations!

11:38.410 --> 11:41.110
Oh, what kind of a person is he?

11:41.110 --> 11:44.350
Why has he appeared in front of me?

11:44.350 --> 11:47.190
If it was that simplistic, it would be great.

11:47.190 --> 11:50.520
No, Miss Himeno. It is that simple.

11:51.460 --> 11:53.360
If you don't know the reason,

11:53.360 --> 11:57.090
...finding out is the first step to solving the problem.

11:57.090 --> 12:00.260
Being disturbed without knowing why will get you nowhere.

12:00.260 --> 12:03.430
Things tend to be rather simplistic.

12:07.510 --> 12:09.110
Thank you, Mikage!

12:09.110 --> 12:12.240
He is, yes! A prince of a foreign country!

12:12.240 --> 12:15.150
What? What's the matter, Himeno?

12:15.150 --> 12:18.850
That's right, I don't know anything about the Princess of Disaster.

12:18.850 --> 12:21.950
I didn't even try to find out until now.

12:21.950 --> 12:24.820
Once I learn something about her, maybe something will change!

12:26.460 --> 12:27.420
Mannen!

12:28.460 --> 12:30.190
Hey! We found you!

12:30.190 --> 12:32.460
Where have you been?! We looked every...

12:32.460 --> 12:33.520
Perfect!

12:34.730 --> 12:36.130
About the Princess of Disaster?

12:36.130 --> 12:38.940
Yeah, it can be anything you know.

12:38.940 --> 12:39.940
Tell me!

12:39.940 --> 12:46.010
So you say, but everything I know is just plain boring.

12:46.010 --> 12:47.710
I don't care if it's boring!

12:48.350 --> 12:50.410
He doesn't know anything.

12:50.410 --> 12:54.550
Shut up! Don't say unnecessary things like that!

12:54.550 --> 12:59.860
We were told Mannen and all of us were born after the Princess of Disaster was imprisoned.

13:00.590 --> 13:02.060
I see...

13:02.060 --> 13:03.790
You blabbermouth.

13:03.790 --> 13:06.930
Say, why don't we go to where she was imprisoned?

13:06.930 --> 13:08.500
Shin, you dumbass!

13:08.500 --> 13:13.200
If we do that, Go will definitely kick our asses for sure!

13:13.200 --> 13:16.440
Where is this place of imprisonment, anyway?

13:16.440 --> 13:17.640
Well...

13:17.640 --> 13:18.800
Leafenia.

13:20.240 --> 13:22.110
You blabbermouth!

13:22.750 --> 13:24.010
Leafenia...

13:25.850 --> 13:27.480
So, there are zero clues.

13:27.790 --> 13:31.410
Which means the Princess of Disaster isn't stupid enough to leave a trail behind.

13:33.060 --> 13:34.660
What's the matter, Sasame?

13:34.660 --> 13:36.150
I'm concerned about Himeno.

13:36.960 --> 13:37.930
Me too.

13:38.360 --> 13:40.630
We ought to change shifts with Mannen soon.

13:55.950 --> 13:58.050
Wow! How beautiful!

13:58.050 --> 13:59.780
This is Leafenia?

13:59.780 --> 14:02.950
Never mind that. Just keep your promise, okay?

14:02.950 --> 14:06.760
I know, you want chocolate chip ice cream, right?

14:06.760 --> 14:08.660
I haven't forgotten.

14:08.660 --> 14:11.260
But when I see a place as beautiful as this...

14:11.260 --> 14:15.260
To think such a horrific thing is going on seems like a lie.

14:16.930 --> 14:17.800
Himeno!

14:24.410 --> 14:26.400
Are you all right, Himeno?

14:27.950 --> 14:32.080
Don't surprise me like that.

14:33.150 --> 14:34.490
This feeling...

14:34.490 --> 14:35.610
Could it be?

14:38.990 --> 14:40.360
What's that?

14:40.360 --> 14:43.930
That's where the Princess of Disaster was imprisoned.

14:43.930 --> 14:47.800
When the Princess of Disaster broke the seal, the Leafe was absorbed.

14:51.700 --> 14:53.240
So this is where she was sealed?

14:53.240 --> 14:55.900
She was imprisoned in that tree.

14:56.440 --> 14:59.140
I'm asking you. Can I go a little closer?

14:59.140 --> 15:01.510
Geez, can't be helped.

15:01.510 --> 15:03.840
Then you'd better make that chocolate chip ice cream a double!

15:15.590 --> 15:18.200
The air seems a bit heavy.

15:18.200 --> 15:21.530
The Princess of Disaster's will probably left a residue.

15:25.640 --> 15:28.200
So this is where the Princess of Disaster...

15:36.380 --> 15:37.610
Lipstick?

15:42.250 --> 15:43.350
Oh, damn!

15:43.350 --> 15:45.120
Where have you guys been?

15:46.060 --> 15:48.590
We were just out for a little walk.

15:48.590 --> 15:50.160
We took a lap around here, and...

15:50.160 --> 15:51.750
Using the road of light?

15:52.700 --> 15:55.260
You went to Leafenia.

15:56.330 --> 16:00.200
I wanted to know about the Princess of Disaster so I went to where she was sealed.

16:00.200 --> 16:01.500
You punks!

16:02.540 --> 16:03.740
Stop it, Go!

16:03.740 --> 16:07.340
I made them take me. These kids have done nothing wrong.

16:07.340 --> 16:13.810
I didn't know anything, and fighting without knowing anything isn't possible.

16:14.590 --> 16:16.850
Tell me more about Fenrir, the Princess of Disaster!

16:16.850 --> 16:19.390
Please! I want to know!

16:19.390 --> 16:21.120
There's no need for you to know.

16:21.860 --> 16:23.090
Hayate...

16:23.090 --> 16:25.000
That's right, Himeno.

16:25.000 --> 16:27.700
There are things you're better off not knowing.

16:27.700 --> 16:29.000
Not knowing...

16:29.000 --> 16:32.440
Fenrir, the Princess of Disaster, was not born a demon.

16:32.440 --> 16:33.500
Kei!

16:33.500 --> 16:36.310
Sooner or later, Himeno will learn of this.

16:36.310 --> 16:39.110
She was originally human.

16:40.410 --> 16:43.150
The Princess of Disaster was human?

16:43.150 --> 16:45.050
Yes, then, she...

16:46.080 --> 16:47.110
What the hell is that?!

17:00.160 --> 17:01.960
Could this be...

17:04.540 --> 17:05.760
Look out, Himeno!

17:14.040 --> 17:15.580
Is it a demon larva?

17:15.580 --> 17:17.950
It assimilated with the building!

17:17.950 --> 17:21.190
But how?! I didn't feel anything!

17:21.190 --> 17:24.690
It's the same with us. We checked this area out earlier!

17:24.690 --> 17:26.860
So it masked its presence.

17:26.860 --> 17:29.620
The demon larva evolved! Be careful!

17:37.500 --> 17:38.940
It took cover again!

17:38.940 --> 17:40.640
Shin, the containment field!

17:40.640 --> 17:44.310
It's not possible! If we don't drag them out of the buildings,

17:44.310 --> 17:46.840
...we can't take them into the other dimensional field.

17:46.840 --> 17:48.510
Himeno! Prét with me!

18:31.790 --> 18:33.890
The Princess of Disaster?! Where?!

18:33.890 --> 18:35.450
Himeno! Relax!

18:42.270 --> 18:44.360
The Princess of Disaster was human.

18:47.200 --> 18:48.260
What are you doing, Himeno?!

18:48.810 --> 18:49.710
Himeno?!

18:49.710 --> 18:52.140
Himeno! Concentrate on the battle!

18:52.140 --> 18:56.450
Kei, why did she become the Princess of Disaster?

18:56.450 --> 18:58.050
What are you asking at a time like this?!

18:58.050 --> 19:00.150
Please! Tell me!

19:00.150 --> 19:04.460
It's because she gave in to her evil side.

19:04.460 --> 19:09.060
That's all? That's all she did and got all that power?!

19:09.060 --> 19:10.960
What's the matter, Himeno?!

19:10.960 --> 19:12.560
She didn't get the power.

19:12.560 --> 19:16.030
She already had the power, only the direction of her power changed.

19:16.030 --> 19:19.200
Changed? What was she, anyway?!

19:19.200 --> 19:20.800
She was...

19:20.800 --> 19:22.970
Takako was a Prétear.

19:26.640 --> 19:27.300
Damn it!

19:31.650 --> 19:32.550
Himeno!

19:32.550 --> 19:33.550
Damn...

19:33.550 --> 19:34.610
Kei!

19:37.860 --> 19:38.820
Himeno!

19:48.330 --> 19:49.770
Now, Himeno!

19:53.600 --> 19:54.590
Himeno!

19:59.440 --> 20:01.210
Light Chakram!

20:17.590 --> 20:19.900
Damn, it got away.

20:19.900 --> 20:21.020
Why?

20:21.870 --> 20:26.670
Why didn't you tell me the Princess of Disaster was once a Prétear?

20:27.400 --> 20:29.210
Himeno...

20:29.210 --> 20:31.440
Was it because I might become the Princess of Disaster too?

20:31.440 --> 20:32.840
That's not it.

20:32.840 --> 20:34.750
Then why?!

20:34.750 --> 20:37.940
Why did you keep this from me?! Explain that!

20:46.260 --> 20:48.490
Hajime, Shin, come here!

20:48.490 --> 20:51.700
Hey, what're you doing, Go?! Let go!

20:51.700 --> 20:53.090
You're coming with me!

20:53.930 --> 20:55.260
Why?

21:09.850 --> 21:10.810
Himeno...

21:11.620 --> 21:13.610
I'll tell you an old story.

21:23.190 --> 21:28.890
Staring out the window of a room with the lights off

21:23.190 --> 21:28.890
akari o keshita heya no mado kara miru

21:28.890 --> 21:33.130
The stars shine in the night sky

21:28.890 --> 21:33.130
yozora ni hoshi ga hikaru

21:33.130 --> 21:39.000
Today will definitely be a search for your constellation

21:33.130 --> 21:39.000
kyo koso anata no seiza sagashi

21:39.000 --> 21:41.870
To give you an arbitrary jinx

21:39.000 --> 21:41.870
katte na jinkusu

21:41.870 --> 21:47.850
If you find the seventh star, then it's the Lucky Star

21:41.870 --> 21:47.850
nanatsume no hoshi o mitsuketara <i>Lucky</i> <i>Star</i>

21:47.850 --> 21:51.820
Tomorrow, with a happy face

21:47.850 --> 21:51.820
ashita wa egao de

21:51.820 --> 21:57.920
I'll greet you good morning

21:51.820 --> 21:57.920
ohayoutte koe o kakete ageru wa

21:57.920 --> 22:02.230
It's a special thing you can't do anything about

21:57.920 --> 22:02.230
shikatanai tokubetsu

22:02.230 --> 22:03.590
My Sweet Heart

22:02.230 --> 22:03.590
My Sweet Heart

22:03.590 --> 22:09.900
I can't be the only one engrossed in all of this

22:03.590 --> 22:09.900
watashi bakari ga muchuu da nante masaka

22:09.900 --> 22:13.670
It just can't be, and I won't stand for it

22:09.900 --> 22:13.670
arienai yurusenai

22:13.670 --> 22:20.680
I want to see what you're feeling in your heart

22:13.670 --> 22:20.680
anata no naka no kimochi nozokitai

22:20.680 --> 22:29.020
To do it secretly, without you knowing

22:20.680 --> 22:29.020
kizukarenai you ni naisho de

22:41.410 --> 22:42.710
I have to do my best!

22:42.710 --> 22:45.740
Miss Himeno, you don't look well.

22:45.740 --> 22:47.040
I have to do my best.

22:47.040 --> 22:50.050
But maybe I can't...

22:47.510 --> 22:50.410
Can't Protect Anyone Anymore
